      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.shahar.node.direction.shahar.opening",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s2.eve.shahar.asset.sprite.shahar",
        "actorId": "shahar",
        "slot": "center",
        "scale": "compact"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.shahar.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.shahar.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "待ち合わせは、屋上だった。シャハルの待ち合わせは、いつも高い場所だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.shahar.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.shahar.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "着くと、銀白の鱗が一枚、床に置いてあった。「乗って」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.shahar.node.line.001c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.shahar.line.001c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……この鱗、エレベーターなんだ。世界でいちばん贅沢な。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.shahar.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.shahar.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "鱗は、音もなく夜空を昇った。祭りの提灯が、下でひと繋がりの光の川になる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.shahar.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.shahar.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "雲を一枚抜けたところで、止まった。ここが、彼女の言う「良い席」だ。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.shahar.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.shahar.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "古竜の本体は、雲の向こうで、静かに息をしていた。息のたび、雲の形が変わる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.shahar.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.shahar.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「身じろぎ一つで、三県の天気が変わるんですよね」と言ったら、少し得意げな気配がした。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.shahar.node.line.003c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.shahar.line.003c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「今夜は、行儀よくしてる」",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.shahar.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.shahar.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「明日の空の話を、しに来た」シャハルは、雲の海を指した。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.shahar.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.shahar.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「あの雲を、朝までに、南へ動かす。そうすると、決勝の刻限に、会場の真上だけ、晴れる」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.shahar.node.line.004c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.shahar.line.004c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……天気の、仕込みだ。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.shahar.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.shahar.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "規模のおかしい応援を、私は今、受けている。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.shahar.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.shahar.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "お礼の言葉を探していたら、先に聞かれた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.shahar.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.shahar.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「ミミ。怖い?」名前の呼び方が、風のように軽かった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.shahar.node.line.006c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.shahar.line.006c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……少し。耳が、思わず、ぴくりと動く。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.shahar.node.line.006d",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.shahar.line.006d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「ん。私も、初めて人前で飛んだ日は、怖かった」四百年前の話を、昨日のことみたいに言う。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.shahar.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.shahar.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「でも、飛んだら、分かった。見てる人がいると、空は、落ちる場所じゃなくて、舞台になる」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.shahar.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.shahar.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「だから明日」と彼女は言った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.shahar.node.line.007c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.shahar.line.007c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「空を見上げる暇があったら、それは私の合図。——胸を張って」",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.shahar.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.shahar.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "鱗が、ゆっくり降りていく。光の川が、近づいてくる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.shahar.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.eve.shahar.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "降り立つ寸前、頬に、あたたかい風が一度だけ吹いた。竜の、おやすみの言い方だ。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.shahar.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "sharedPoints",
          "amount": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "main.s2.eve.shahar.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
